Aim:
To develop a BlossomGifts website for ordering flowers and gifts online.

Algorithm:

Create the webpage structure using HTML.
Apply CSS to design the website layout.
Use JavaScript to display flowers and gift items.
Allow users to search and filter products.
Display product images, names, and prices.
Enable users to add items to the shopping cart.
Calculate the total price of selected items.
Allow users to enter delivery details and place orders.

Result:
The BlossomGifts website was developed successfully to browse flowers and gifts and place orders online.
